@controller c2_plate plate at 1,14 accepts F
@actuator a2_platform platform at 7,18 controlled_by all(c2_plate)
@controller c3_plate plate at 8,23 accepts W
@actuator a3_platform platform at 2,27 controlled_by all(c3_plate)
@controller c4_plate plate at 1,32 accepts F
@actuator a4_platform platform at 7,36 controlled_by all(c4_plate)
@controller c5_toggle toggle at 8,41
@actuator a5_platform platform at 2,45 controlled_by all(c5_toggle)
@oneway J allows RIGHT
